{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8df8a515f5e4781ac94b80366a95d42a9f6c2cc6b02ff76f971fc398c8f23d02", "ja": "莉緒、ブログ書いてくれてありがとう。\n新しい衣装はどんな感じだ？", "zh": "莉绪，谢谢你帮忙写博客。\n新服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "1e785d88d36b9b5c051a370bc30fdccb7925ad44ce958d204ef20ebb0354f312", "ja": "ふぅ……あら、{$P$}くん。\nお疲れさま……。", "zh": "呼……啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "f2861a08e20e4019d991405bcd5439a6b1064ebdcc9e42645246bbc37fbc5655", "ja": "この衣装……ちょうどいいセクシーで、可愛くて……\nとっても、ステキだと思うわ……ふぅ。", "zh": "这套服装……性感得恰到好处，又很可爱……\n我觉得特别棒……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5e903f45ace9b79667e9383c6737595ab427ed7fbdcb60cd543c40b6500c6e8b", "ja": "そ、それは良かった……。ところで莉緒。\nそんなにため息ついて、体調でも悪いのか？", "zh": "那、那就好……对了，莉绪。\n你一直叹气，是不是身体不舒服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "b4d7f3a0f4db05a6398b33dd63ddd0de517c2e0182fa32a82d7f6416d6bd9a92", "ja": "えっ？　……んもう、違う～！\n体調不良じゃなくて研究よ、セクシーの研究！", "zh": "诶？……真是的，不是那样啦～！\n不是身体不舒服，是在研究啦，研究性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "2b00d30b11491becaf873705a0a2920b3c43a85496c23e6db3a224b66d6c57d5", "ja": "ほら、こんなにオトナ可愛い衣装なんだもの。\nみんなをトリコにするチャンスでしょ！？", "zh": "你看，这套服装多么成熟又可爱。\n这可是把大家迷得神魂颠倒的机会吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "720b3e23c781f884141d789504d1221c7ca8f9def75a5550a12cec544e7fd500", "ja": "そこで研究してたってわけ！　さっきのは、\n『エレガントセクシー』って感じかな♪　ウフフ！", "zh": "原来我就是在研究这个嘛！刚才那套，感觉属于“优雅性感”吧♪呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e7fef96668ce0ed6654f4d7b41cf9d6f4814ad644486636bd36f3d09905f268d", "ja": "『エレガントセクシー』……。あのため息が？", "zh": "“优雅性感”……？刚才那声叹气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "06a5d76ca9c5b120a4e1951168536555de44c9b4551874afa161b0a08b0180c4", "ja": "ため息じゃないわよ～！　あれは、清廉された\n大人の女性の演出！　色っぽい吐息なの！", "zh": "才不是叹气呢～！那是清纯高雅的成熟女性表演！是妩媚的吐息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "b949bf947a9f6f154309301d30dac78d3fe1fc11994bb76251dcad20ac796b6c", "ja": "エレガントな女性って、自分からは攻めないんでしょ？\n知ってるんだから。映画でもだいたいそうだし～♪", "zh": "优雅的女性，不会主动出击的吧？\n我可是知道的。电影里基本也都是这样的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "dc540633c7bf2f7c0eb8bf51e71c008c839aca7edb93fb1f9ceefa04cd5a04e8", "ja": "そ、そう……かな？　でも今のままでも莉緒は\nじゅうぶん、みんなをトリコにできると思うけどなあ。", "zh": "是、是这样……吗？不过我觉得，莉绪现在这样也已经足够让大家为之着迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "33bb2dbde34f1d4656b081bafa170af1b39b21d7995e9391d0d312ca6e4fd021", "ja": "えっ、ホント？　{$P$}くん、ホント\nにそう思う？　私にドキドキする？　……今、してる？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？{$P$}，你真的这么想？会对我心动吗？……现在，正在心动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_1013", "source_sha256": "f4acaf644a1a3a07f6a69c834c330444b5b05d3d3046cb9baeb98e2e976f3b46", "ja": "ドキドキ", "zh": "（心跳不已）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f36abd4cc78393eccb42e141fb2e5d7fc5ce3c9a345f021b18dc5e354a9186c9", "ja": "うん、してるかな。\n聞かれてますますドキドキしてきた気がする。", "zh": "嗯，可能是吧。被你这么一问，感觉反而更加心跳加速了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2001_046rio", "source_sha256": "8e116a7a3327e6f7dd2c974aeedab1b7ca0963ffe92ac9418a77d5a829de7a25", "ja": "やった～！　ありがと、{$P$}くん！\nよしっ、これで第一段階クリアね！", "zh": "太好啦～！谢谢你，{$P$}弟弟！\n好，这样第一阶段就顺利通过啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2002_p", "source_sha256": "f5f5538f61be17fa9b6f122b4f7949a5935ef59fcb46b1fe81abc6e263d3a20c", "ja": "え？　第一段階？", "zh": "咦？第一阶段？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2003_046rio", "source_sha256": "0c0196a845762650c824352d64273c9d5baad3963dc47002b56ecdead9a9c411", "ja": "そっ♪　ドキドキするだけじゃ、すぐ終わっちゃう\nでしょ？　ゴールはみんなをトリコにすること！", "zh": "没错♪光是让人心动，很快就会结束的，对吧？目标可是要让大家都为之着迷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2004_046rio", "source_sha256": "3ecb0c0d48681c90d6ca1ed6fe145ec491d47624e333f8997c7235bae20daf4d", "ja": "そのためには……、もっと胸元を下げてもいいのかな？\nでもエレガントじゃないわよね？　はあ、悩むわ～！", "zh": "为了达到这个目的……领口再往下开一点也可以吗？\n可是那样就不优雅了吧？唉，好纠结啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2005_046rio", "source_sha256": "22de4474c0a1a5743d039efede678de00de9bf4c18c1529807227f5821694886", "ja": "あ、でもスカートの裾を上げる手もあるわよね？\n脚を見せるのはエレガントな気がするし……。", "zh": "啊，不过把裙摆往上提也不失为一个办法吧？\n露出腿来感觉会更优雅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2006_046rio", "source_sha256": "510d649d54f5962d3a9a9ba24a8b370d00b9bfdb3db5d238f8512beb1da6d407", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}くんは私の胸と脚、\nどっちが好き？　どっちが見たい？　ねえってば～！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}先生，你更喜欢我的胸还是腿？更想看哪一个？喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0204_2007_p", "source_sha256": "9d76af4e1de2016bc5cf0e2124568bdb2fc23f7b81f3c7e7aacc5ceb496813f7", "ja": "（ふぅ……。おっと、思わず出そうになった吐息……\nではなく、ため息を飲み込んで。どう説得したものか）", "zh": "（呼……。糟糕，刚才差点发出叹息……\n不对，是差点叹气，我把它咽了回去。该怎么劝她才好呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
